2 and H1 FY27 results. The company reported H1 FY27 bookings of INR1,338 crores, a 120% year-on-year increase. Q2 FY27 presales reached INR906 crores, more than double the previous year. Revenue for H1 FY27 grew 96% to INR475 crores, with profit after tax rising fourfold to INR120 crores. Net debt stood at INR200 crores as on 30th September 2026. The company revised its FY27 bookings growth guidance upward to INR2,600 crores to INR2,700 crores. Management expressed confidence in achieving the upper end of the GDV addition guidance of INR4,000 crores to INR5,000 crores. The transcript is available on the company website.", "voiceUrl": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.in/ann_voice/539301_11112026141244_ASLTranscriptQ2H1FY27.mp3"}, {"an_dt": "06-Nov-2026 16:13:48", "attFileSize": "588.48 KB", "attchmntFile": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/539301_06112026161208_ASLOutcomeOfConcallAudioRecording.pdf", "attchmntText": "Arvind SmartSpaces Limited has informed the Exchange about Link of Recording", "bflag": null, "csvName": null, "desc": "Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con. Call Updates", "difference": "00:00:01", "dt": "06112026161348", "exchdisstime": "06-Nov-2026 16:13:49", "fileSize": "588.48 KB", "hasXbrl": true, "old_new": null, "orgid": null, "seq_id": "106850613", "smIndustry": null, "sm_isin": "INE034S01021", "sm_name": "Arvind SmartSpaces Limited", "sort_date": "2026-11-06 16:13:48", "symbol": "ARVSMART", "voiceSummary": null, "voiceUrl": null}, {"an_dt": "06-Nov-2026 12:20:47", "attFileSize": "5.78 MB", "attchmntFile": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/539301_06112026122035_NewspaperResultsQ2H1FY27.pdf", "attchmntText": "Arvind SmartSpaces Limited has informed the Exchange about Copy of Newspaper Publication", "bflag": null, "csvName": null, "desc": "Copy of Newspaper Publication", "difference": "00:00:01", "dt": "06112026122047", "exchdisstime": "06-Nov-2026 12:20:48", "fileSize": "5.78 MB", "hasXbrl": true, "old_new": null, "orgid": nu